ExcelGRAG is distributed under `MIT OR Apache-2.0` (see `LICENSE-MIT` and
`LICENSE-APACHE`). It builds on the crates below, whose licences ask that their
notices travel with any distribution — Apache-2.0 §4(d) most explicitly, and
